    "Divisions": "Indeling",
    "12 months, 28 to 31 days, unrelated to the moon": "12 maanden van 28 tot 31 dagen, los van de maan",
    "13 moons, each one lunar cycle on average": "13 manen, elk gemiddeld één maancyclus",
    "Year vs. cycle length": "Lengte van jaar of cyclus",
    "365 or 366, leap rules": "365 of 366, schrikkelregels",
    "369, always": "369, altijd",
